# On the Design of Extended Spatial Document Engines

@pages size="A4" margin=32
@page number=1
# On the Design of Extended Spatial Document Engines

*Abstract* — We present Zolto Phase 8, a zero-dependency document engine that combines Markdown, Math, Diagrams, Charts, Vector Graphics, and Spatial Layouts into a declarative syntax. The system produces 642 passing tests across 8 completed phases.

---

## 1. Introduction

Technical documents require multi-column layouts, spatial grids, mathematical equations, and embedded charts.

